Euler/Heegner prime-window boundary scout (S649)

Exact identity:
  f_p(x) = x^2 + x + p = ((2x+1)^2 + d)/4 with d=4p-1
  f_p(p-1) = p^2, so x=p-1 is the forced square endpoint

