Boundary reading
  zero-based run length p-1 == Hamiltonian spine length on p vertices
  interior inputs x=1..p-2 have count p-2 == Moon c3 floor for strong p-tournaments
  endpoint x=p-1 folds to p^2, a square sink rather than another prime
  after fixing the spine, the tournament deformation budget is C(p-1,2)

